    "sections": {
        "description": "Business Association is designed for professional groups, chambers, and networking organizations. The homepage layout includes a header with navigation links such as Home, About Us, Membership, Resources, Events, Gallery, and Contact. The hero section provides space for a headline, supporting text, and call-to-action buttons. A member showcase area displays profile images to highlight community participation. The theme also includes a testimonial section titled What Our Members Say, allowing organizations to share member feedback with names, locations, and ratings. The layout uses a responsive design to ensure compatibility across devices. It provides structured sections suitable for presenting organizational information, membership details, events, and announcements in a clear and organized format."
    },
